@	
o	-v|--version	Display version information	
o	-h|--help	Print help message for julia (--help-hidden for more)	
o	--help-hidden	Uncommon options not shown by `-h`	
o	--project	Set given directory as the home project/environment	V
o	-J|--sysimage	Start up with the given system image file	v
o	-H|--home	Set location of `julia` executable	v
o	--startup-file	Load `~/.julia/config/startup.jl`	v
o	--handle-signals	Enable or disable Julia's default signal handlers	v
o	--sysimage-native-code	Use native code from system image if available	v
o	--compiled-modules	Enable or disable incremental precompilation of modules	v
o	-e|--eval	Evaluate given expr	v
o	-E|--print	Evaluate given expr and display the result	v
o	-L|--load	Load given file immediately on all processors	v
o	-t|--threads	Enable N threads; "auto" sets N to the number of local CPU threads	v
o	-p|--procs	Integer value N launches N additional local worker processes "auto" launches as many workers as…	v
o	--machine-file	Run processes on hosts listed in given file	v
o	-i	Interactive mode; REPL runs and isinteractive() is true	
o	-q|--quiet	Quiet startup: no banner, suppress REPL warnings	
o	--banner	Enable or disable startup banner	v
o	--color	Enable or disable color text	v
o	--history-file	Load or save history	v
o	--depwarn	Enable or disable syntax and method deprecation warnings ("error" turns warnings into errors)	v
o	--warn-overwrite	Enable or disable method overwrite warnings	v
o	--warn-scope	Enable or disable warning for ambiguous top-level scope	v
o	-C|--cpu-target	Limit usage of CPU features up to <target>; set to "help" to see the available options	v
o	-O|--optimize	Set the optimization level (default level is 2 if unspecified or 3 if used without a level)	V
o	-g	Enable / Set the level of debug info generation	V
o	--inline	Control whether inlining is permitted, including overriding @inline declarations	v
o	--check-bounds	Emit bounds checks always, never, or respect @inbounds declarations	v
o	--polly	Enable or disable the polyhedral optimizer Polly (overrides @polly declaration)	v
o	--math-mode	Disallow or enable unsafe floating point optimizations (overrides @fastmath declaration)	v
o	--code-coverage	Count executions of source lines (omitting setting is equivalent to "user")	V
o	--track-allocation	Count bytes allocated by each source line (omitting setting is equivalent to "user")	V
o	--bug-report	Launch a bug report session. It can be used to start a REPL, run a script, or evaluate…	v
o	--compile	Enable or disable JIT compiler, or request exhaustive or minimal compilation	v
o	--output-o	Generate an object file (including system image data)	v
o	--output-ji	Generate a system image data file (.ji)	v
o	--output-unopt-bc	Generate unoptimized LLVM bitcode (.bc)	v
o	--output-jit-bc	Dump all IR generated by the frontend (not including system image)	v
o	--output-bc	Generate LLVM bitcode (.bc)	v
o	--output-asm	Generate an assembly file (.s)	v
o	--output-incremental	Generate an incremental output file (rather than complete)	v
o	--image-codegen	Force generate code in imaging mode	
